------------- VBBS Main Menu -----------------
Return here with "main"   Get help with "help"
    m = feedback messages     s = SIG messages
    f = files                 term to get TERM
    ! = conference               bye to logout
    new = goto new files        quit to logout
    misc = account maintainance menu
    dl = download                  ul = upload
    proto = pick a file transfer protocol
----------------------------------------------
